  "text_md": "24\n\n25\n\n26\n\nTable  S1:  Statistical  results  of  the  Shapiro  (W),  Pearson  correlation  (r)  and  holm Bonferroni tests, with their p values, applied on our dataset of metal concentrations in the different bat tissues and soil concentrations (NSRI dataset).\n\n| Metal    | Statistical test              | Kidneys          | Liver            | Stomach          | Bones            | Soil             | Fur              |\n|----------|-------------------------------|------------------|------------------|------------------|------------------|------------------|------------------|\n| Cd       | Shapiro   W  P value          | 0.46   < 2.2e-16 | 0.15  < 2.2e-16  | 0.27   < 2.2e-16 | 0.13  < 2.2e-16  | 0.46   < 2.2e-16 | 0.05   < 2.2e-16 |\n| Cd       | Pearson  r  p value           | 0.37   4.058e-07 | 0.23  0.002257   | 0.54  5.358e-13  | 0.53  2.887e-14  | 0.10   0.1846    | -                |\n| Cd       | Bonferroni  Adjusted p  value | 1.2174e-06       | 4.5140e-03       | 2.1432e-12       | 1.4435e-13       | 1.8460e-01       | -                |\n| Cu       | Shapiro test  W  P value      | 0.56  < 2.2e-16  | 0.63   < 2.2e-16 | 0.40   < 2.2e-16 | 0.63   < 2.2e-16 | 0.40   < 2.2e-16 | 0.68  < 2.2e-16  |\n| Cu       | Pearson  r  p value           | 0.39  2.066e-08  | 0.24  0.0009522  | 0.41  5.346e-08  | 0.25  0.0004402  | 0.09   0.2359    | -                |\n| Cu       | Bonferroni  Adjusted p  value | 1.0330e-07       | 1.9044e-03       | 2.1384e-07       | 1.3206e-03       | 2.3590e-01       | -                |\n| Pb       | Shapiro test  W  P value      | 0.35  < 2.2e-16  | 0.13  < 2.2e-16  | 0.33  < 2.2e-16  | 0.73  < 2.2e-16  | 0.41  < 2.2e-16  | 0.17  < 2.2e-16  |\n| Pb       | Pearson  r  p value           | 0.42  1.367e-09  | 0.10   0.1934    | 0.75   < 2.2e-16 | 0.72   < 2.2e-16 | 0.04   0.5742    | -                |\n| Pb       | Bonferroni  Adjusted p  value | 4.101e-09        | 3.868e-01        | 1.100e-15        | 1.100e-15        | 5.742e-01        | -                |\n| Zn       | Shapiro test  W  P value      | 0.55  < 2.2e-16  | 0.21  < 2.2e-16  | 0.19  < 2.2e-16  | 0.88  3.833e-11  | 0.37  < 2.2e-16  | 0.66  < 2.2e-16  |\n| Zn       | Pearson  r  p value           | 0.19  0.007064   | -0.07  0.346     | 0.39  2.301e-07  | 0.36  2.24e-07   | 0.04  0.5378     | -                |\n| Zn       | Bonferroni  Adjusted p  value | 0.02119200       | 0.69200000       | 0.00000112       | 0.00000112       | 0.69200000       | -                |\n\n27\n\n28\n\n29",
